---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="es"
  title="Paleta de Colores"
  description="Vista de prueba para comparar acentos de marca (cyan, morado, rosa, verde, amarillo) con el azul base."
  robots="noindex, nofollow"
  currentPath="/paleta-colores/"
>
  <section class="py-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-6 dark:text-white">Paleta de Colores</h1>
    <p class="text-center text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 text-sm md:text-base">
      Compara cómo se ven los distintos acentos de marca para CTAs, enlaces, tarjetas y el botón del chatbot. Azul (brand-blue) se mantiene como color de marca base.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      {/* Cyan */}
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/10 bg-white dark:bg-monokai-bg shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center">
          <span class="inline-block w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full mr-2" style="background:#1EAEDB"></span>
          Cyan (CTA)
          <span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-500 ml-2">#1EAEDB / #66D9EF</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-x-2 space-y-2">
          <a class="inline-block bg-brand-cyan text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 cursor-pointer text-sm">CTA primario</a>
          <a class="inline-block border border-brand-cyan text-brand-cyan font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-cyan/10 cursor-pointer text-sm">CTA secundario</a>
          <a class="inline-block text-brand-cyan hover:underline cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium">Enlace de ejemplo</a>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-blue/30 dark:border-brand-blue/40 text-xs">Tarjeta con borde Azul base</div>
      </div>

      {/* Purple */}
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/10 bg-white dark:bg-monokai-bg shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center">
          <span class="inline-block w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full mr-2" style="background:#7C5CE4"></span>
          Morado (CTA)
          <span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-500 ml-2">#7C5CE4 / #AE81FF</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-x-2 space-y-2">
          <a class="inline-block bg-brand-purple text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 cursor-pointer text-sm">CTA primario</a>
          <a class="inline-block border border-brand-purple text-brand-purple font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-purple/10 cursor-pointer text-sm">CTA secundario</a>
          <a class="inline-block text-brand-purple hover:underline cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium">Enlace de ejemplo</a>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-blue/30 dark:border-brand-blue/40 text-xs">Tarjeta con borde Azul base</div>
      </div>

      {/* Pink */}
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/10 bg-white dark:bg-monokai-bg shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center">
          <span class="inline-block w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full mr-2" style="background:#C2175A"></span>
          Rosa (CTA)
          <span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-500 ml-2">#C2175A / #F92672</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-x-2 space-y-2">
          <a class="inline-block bg-brand-pink text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 cursor-pointer text-sm">CTA primario</a>
          <a class="inline-block border border-brand-pink text-brand-pink font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-pink/10 cursor-pointer text-sm">CTA secundario</a>
          <a class="inline-block text-brand-pink hover:underline cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium">Enlace de ejemplo</a>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-blue/30 dark:border-brand-blue/40 text-xs">Tarjeta con borde Azul base</div>
      </div>

      {/* Green */}
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/10 bg-white dark:bg-monokai-bg shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center">
          <span class="inline-block w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full mr-2" style="background:#7FBF1E"></span>
          Verde (estado/CTA)
          <span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-500 ml-2">#7FBF1E / #A6E22E</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-x-2 space-y-2">
          <a class="inline-block bg-brand-green text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 cursor-pointer text-sm">CTA primario</a>
          <a class="inline-block border border-brand-green text-brand-green font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-green/10 cursor-pointer text-sm">CTA secundario</a>
          <a class="inline-block text-brand-green hover:underline cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium">Enlace de ejemplo</a>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-blue/30 dark:border-brand-blue/40 text-xs">Tarjeta con borde Azul base</div>
      </div>

      {/* Yellow */}
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/10 bg-white dark:bg-monokai-bg shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center">
          <span class="inline-block w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full mr-2" style="background:#E6DB74"></span>
          Amarillo (highlight)
          <span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-500 ml-2">#E6DB74</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-x-2 space-y-2">
          <a class="inline-block bg-brand-yellow text-gray-900 font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 cursor-pointer text-sm">CTA primario</a>
          <a class="inline-block border border-brand-yellow text-gray-900 font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-yellow/30 cursor-pointer text-sm">CTA secundario</a>
          <a class="inline-block text-gray-900 dark:text-monokai-yellow hover:underline cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium">Enlace de ejemplo</a>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-blue/30 dark:border-brand-blue/40 text-xs">Tarjeta con borde Azul base</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/10 bg-white dark:bg-monokai-bg shadow-xs">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 dark:text-white">Header y Chatbot</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4 text-sm">El header usa Azul de marca. Aquí puedes simular el color del botón flotante y del chatbot con el acento que elijas.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap text-sm font-semibold">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full" style="background:#2563EB"></span>Header (brand-blue)</span>
        <a class="inline-block bg-brand-cyan text-white py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg">Chatbot Cyan</a>
        <a class="inline-block bg-brand-purple text-white py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg">Chatbot Morado</a>
        <a class="inline-block bg-brand-pink text-white py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg">Chatbot Rosa</a>
        <a class="inline-block bg-brand-green text-white py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg">Chatbot Verde</a>
        <a class="inline-block bg-brand-yellow text-gray-900 py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg">Chatbot Amarillo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
